NOTICE ON THIRD-PARTY CONTENT / 第三方内容说明

This repository does NOT include the original book
《深入理解 AI Agent：设计原理与工程实践》 (by 李博杰) in any form —
neither the PDF nor any extracted full text. The book is a copyrighted work;
please obtain it through legitimate channels.

Concepts, formulas, experiment numbering (e.g. "实验 1-1") and some result
figures referenced in this repository are attributed to that book. The
explanations, visualizations and code here are original re-implementations
for teaching purposes. The book's companion repository is at
https://github.com/bojieli/ai-agent-book

本仓库不包含原书 PDF，也不包含任何原文抽取文本。书中概念、公式、实验编号
与部分结论数字均引自原书；本仓库的讲解、可视化与代码为面向教学的重新实现。
